[1.] 
Cannot control the backlight with the Fn keys in console mode

[2.]  

While under console backlight cannot be controlled using the
Fn+UpDownArrows keyboard keys, under X the backlight can be set with
them. 

The backlight can be set using setpci. 

[3.] 
backlight, Samsung N220, console

[4.]
Linux version 3.6.3 (root@clterm) (gcc version 4.6.3 (Ubuntu/Linaro
4.6.3-1ubuntu5) ) #6 SMP Sun Oct 28 16:46:38 EET 2012

